            "title": "3 US Penny Stocks With At Least $3M Market Cap",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "As the U.S. markets experience a downturn, with major indices like the S&P 500 and Nasdaq Composite extending their slump, investors are keenly observing how different sectors respond to these shifts. Amidst this backdrop, penny stocks\u2014often representing smaller or newer companies\u2014continue to capture attention for their potential value despite their vintage-sounding name. These stocks can offer unique opportunities when they possess strong financial foundations, and in this article, we...",
